  "description": "Kang Yohan, plagued by endless misfortune, turns to the supernatural to change his luck. Too broke for a proper summoning ritual, he settles for a \"\"Do it Yourself\"\" version and ends up with Chung—a so-called \"\"cost-effective\"\" god.But life doesn’t come cheap. Yohan is about to learn two hard truths: you get what you pay for, and nothing comes without a price. Now, he must fulfill Chung’s bizarre conditions to finally escape his cursed fate!\n\n(Source: Lezhin US) \n\n*Note: Part of Blühen's Hageukasang (하극상) Short Story Collection or Downfall Collection in English.*",
